stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> RequestReceived
    RequestReceived --> Rejected: identity / capability / scope failure
    RequestReceived --> CapabilityConsumed: all authorization checks pass
    CapabilityConsumed --> RecordDecrypted: exact lookup + AEAD pass
    CapabilityConsumed --> Rejected: lookup / AEAD / crash / timeout
    RecordDecrypted --> GeneratorInvoked
    RecordDecrypted --> Rejected: crash before generation
    GeneratorInvoked --> OutputCommitted: exact output validation
    GeneratorInvoked --> Rejected: timeout / exception / validation failure
    OutputCommitted --> ResponseDelivered
    OutputCommitted --> UncertainDelivery: response-path crash
    Rejected --> [*]
    ResponseDelivered --> [*]
    UncertainDelivery --> [*]

    note right of CapabilityConsumed
      The original capability is never restored.
      Retry requires a newly authorized capability.
    end note
